# THE ANIMAL PATHS (rome, 2026-10-12). Ways only the animals use. Every exit
# here is keyed beast-path: the engine keeps these out of the ordinary exit
# lists entirely, so no exits line, chip, map, compass or pathfinder ever sees
# one. Animals walk them; a wanderer learns one only by being in the room when
# an animal goes through it, and from then on may walk it too.
#
# Each pair sat side by side on the map with no way between, and ten or more
# steps the long way round, and the animals that use it live within four rooms.
!region wood

## the-deer-lawn | attachment: the roe's way down to the water
!existing
> north the-drip-line key:beast-path

## the-drip-line | attachment: the roe's way down to the water
!existing
> south the-deer-lawn key:beast-path

